## Verification

| Phase | Verification |
|-------|-------------|
| 0 | `dotdog validate` → 100%, `dotdog analyze` → 0 gaps |
| 1 | `dotdog compile` → .dag v1.4 with compact encoding |
| 2 | `npm install -g dotdog` → 12 commands working + CI blocks broken specs |
| 3 | `dotdog serve` → AI agent queries spec via MCP |
| 4 | `dotdog search "entity"` → returns Node, Edge, Task, Prediction, Vector |
| 5 | `dotdog simulate payment` → walks through steps, reports success/failure |
| 6 | Prediction "shipping by July" resolved → hit rate updates |
| 7 | Dashboard shows 3 projects, 87% avg completeness |
| 8 | `dotdog generate demo` → produces working React component |
